(7457811, 1181790, 37858, '<td valign="top">I''m putting this in my top ten.  I do think that some people will have trouble with the idea of shoe-horning this into a town or city "scape" challenge.  Since Petra was an ancient city, this is enough for me.  Out-of-the-box vision for this challenge.  Worthy of a TT vote IMHO.</td>', 'I''m putting this in my top ten.  I do think that some people will have trouble with the idea of shoe-horning this into a town or city "scape" challenge.  Since Petra was an ancient city, this is enough for me.  Out-of-the-box vision for this challenge.  Worthy of a TT vote IMHO.', '2016-06-01 05:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
